    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The plugin provides tools to create a unique timer design that will be placed on the card and product page.<br />\n1. Timers for countdown time<br />\n2. Timer builder<br />\n3. Bulk manager</p>\n<h3>Check out the pro version of the plugin</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://codecanyon.net/item/sales-countdown-timer-builder/59002596\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pro version</a></p>\n<p>The benefits of using Sales Countdown Timer Builder</p>\n<p>Boost sales and create urgency with a countdown timer for discounts and promotions. Display real-time timers on product pages and WooCommerce product cards to highlight flash sales, seasonal offers, and limited-time deals.</p>\n<p>**The main function of the plugin is to help you customize your Countdown Timer to suit your marketing needs.</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>**Bulk manager.</li>\n<li>**Custom timer creating.</li>\n<li>**Countdown timer schedular.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>General instructions for using the plugin</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I_pEXFcVJl0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Timer settings</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3UJRA0Htsu0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Timer Scheduler</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uNAk9K9upCw?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Timer Styles</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wxCV4Mo9mD8?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Working with a Bulk manager for timer</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z5u1ofjlZKo?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download and install Sales Countdown Timer Builder plugin using the built-in WordPress plugin installer.<br />\nIf you download Product Card and Page Customizer plugin manually, make sure it is uploaded to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code><br />\nand activate the plugin through the <code>Plugins</code> menu in WordPress.<br />\nOr follow the steps below:<br />\nPlugins &gt; Add new &gt; Upload plugin &gt; Upload devellux-sales-countdown-timer-builder.zip &gt; Install Now &gt; Activate Plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://timer-demo.develux.top/shop/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Live Demo</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/sale-countdown-timer-builder/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentation</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://codecanyon.net/item/sales-countdown-timer-builder/59002596\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pro version</a></p>\n<p>For all technical questions, please contact us by email plugins_support@develux.com or visit our website develux.com where you can get help setting up the plugin.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>A: For support, please email to plugins_support@develux.com or visit our technical documentation page https://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/sale-countdown-timer-builder/</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support links</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date – 14 July 2025</em></p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Install the Sales Countdown Timer Builder plugin for your WooCommerce store.",
